/* ================================================================================ */
/* Test 1: Computed Fields vs Formula Indexes */
/* ================================================================================ */
"Test 1: Computed Fields vs Formula Indexes\n".echo();
"------------------------------------------\n".echo();

"Understanding the difference between computed fields and formula indexes:\n".echo();

"Computed Fields:\n".echo();
"- Definition: Fields that store computed values derived from other fields\n".echo();
"- Storage: Values are computed and stored in the field\n".echo();
"- Updates: Recalculated when dependent fields change\n".echo();
"- Use Case: Frequently accessed computed values\n".echo();

"Formula Indexes:\n".echo();
"- Definition: Indexes on computed values without storing the computed field\n".echo();
"- Storage: Only the index stores computed values, not a separate field\n".echo();
"- Updates: Recalculated when dependent fields change\n".echo();
"- Use Case: Search optimization without storing redundant data\n".echo();

/* ================================================================================ */
/* Test 2: Computed Fields Examples */
/* ================================================================================ */
"Test 2: Computed Fields Examples\n".echo();
"--------------------------------\n".echo();

"Computed Field Concept: Full name (stored and accessible)\n".echo();
"```grapa\n".echo();
"// Computed field: Full name (stored and accessible)\n".echo();
"group_db.mkcomputedfield(\"full_name\", \"STR\", \"VAR\", \n".echo();
"    \"lambda(record) { record.get('first_name') + ' ' + record.get('last_name') }\");\n".echo();
"```\n".echo();

"Benefits of Computed Fields:\n".echo();
"- Values are stored and can be accessed directly\n".echo();
"- No need to recompute on every access\n".echo();
"- Can be indexed for fast searching\n".echo();
"- Automatic updates when dependent fields change\n".echo();

"Computed Field Concept: Age category (stored and accessible)\n".echo();
"```grapa\n".echo();
"// Computed field: Age category (stored and accessible)\n".echo();
"group_db.mkcomputedfield(\"age_category\", \"STR\", \"VAR\", \n".echo();
"    \"lambda(record) { \n".echo();
"        age = record.get('age').raw().int(); \n".echo();
"        if (age < 30) 'young' \n".echo();
"        else if (age < 50) 'middle' \n".echo();
"        else 'senior' \n".echo();
"    }\");\n".echo();
"```\n".echo();

"Computed Field Concept: Annual salary (stored and accessible)\n".echo();
"```grapa\n".echo();
"// Computed field: Annual salary (stored and accessible)\n".echo();
"group_db.mkcomputedfield(\"annual_salary\", \"INT\", \"FIX\", 4,\n".echo();
"    \"lambda(record) { record.get('salary').raw().int() * 12 }\");\n".echo();
"```\n".echo();

/* ================================================================================ */
/* Test 3: Formula Indexes Examples */
/* ================================================================================ */
"Test 3: Formula Indexes Examples\n".echo();
"--------------------------------\n".echo();

"Formula Index Concept: Index on concatenated name (not stored as field)\n".echo();
"```grapa\n".echo();
"// Index on concatenated name (not stored as field)\n".echo();
"index1 = group_db.mkformulaindex(\"full_name_index\", \n".echo();
"    \"lambda(record) { record.get('first_name') + ' ' + record.get('last_name') }\");\n".echo();
"```\n".echo();

"Benefits of Formula Indexes:\n".echo();
"- No redundant storage of computed values\n".echo();
"- Fast searching on computed values\n".echo();
"- Automatic updates when dependent fields change\n".echo();
"- Memory efficient for large datasets\n".echo();

"Formula Index Concept: Index on age category (not stored as field)\n".echo();
"```grapa\n".echo();
"// Index on age category (not stored as field)\n".echo();
"index2 = group_db.mkformulaindex(\"age_category_index\", \n".echo();
"    \"lambda(record) { \n".echo();
"        age = record.get('age').raw().int(); \n".echo();
"        if (age < 30) 'young' \n".echo();
"        else if (age < 50) 'middle' \n".echo();
"        else 'senior' \n".echo();
"    }\");\n".echo();
"```\n".echo();

"Formula Index Concept: Index on salary percentile (not stored as field)\n".echo();
"```grapa\n".echo();
"// Index on salary percentile within department (not stored as field)\n".echo();
"index3 = group_db.mkformulaindex(\"salary_percentile_index\", \n".echo();
"    \"lambda(record) { \n".echo();
"        salary = record.get('salary').raw().int(); \n".echo();
"        department = record.get('department'); \n".echo();
"        calculatePercentile(salary, department) \n".echo();
"    }\");\n".echo();
"```\n".echo();

/* ================================================================================ */
/* Test 4: Hybrid Approach */
/* ================================================================================ */
"Test 4: Hybrid Approach\n".echo();
"----------------------\n".echo();

"Hybrid Approach: Create computed field and index it\n".echo();
"```grapa\n".echo();
"// Create computed field and index it\n".echo();
"group_db.mkcomputedfield(\"full_name\", \"STR\", \"VAR\", \n".echo();
"    \"lambda(record) { record.get('first_name') + ' ' + record.get('last_name') }\");\n".echo();
"group_db.mkindex(\"full_name_index\", [\"full_name\"]);  // Index the computed field\n".echo();
"```\n".echo();

"Benefits of Hybrid Approach:\n".echo();
"- Computed value is stored for direct access\n".echo();
"- Index provides fast searching\n".echo();
"- Best of both worlds for frequently accessed values\n".echo();
"- Automatic updates maintain consistency\n".echo();

"Use Cases for Each Approach:\n".echo();

"Use Computed Fields When:\n".echo();
"- Value is accessed frequently\n".echo();
"- Computation is expensive\n".echo();
"- Value is used in multiple queries\n".echo();
"- Storage space is not a major concern\n".echo();

"Use Formula Indexes When:\n".echo();
"- Value is only used for searching\n".echo();
"- Storage space is limited\n".echo();
"- Computation is relatively cheap\n".echo();
"- Value is rarely accessed directly\n".echo();

"Use Hybrid Approach When:\n".echo();
"- Value is both frequently accessed and searched\n".echo();
"- Performance is critical for both operations\n".echo();
"- Storage space is available\n".echo();
"- Consistency is important\n".echo();

/* ================================================================================ */
/* Test 5: Implementation Considerations */
/* ================================================================================ */
"Test 5: Implementation Considerations\n".echo();
"------------------------------------\n".echo();

"Unified Formula System Design:\n".echo();

"Extended Field Structure:\n".echo();
"```cpp\n".echo();
"// Extended field structure to support computed fields\n".echo();
"struct GrapaDBField {\n".echo();
"    // ... existing field properties ...\n".echo();
"    \n".echo();
"    // Computed field properties\n".echo();
"    bool isComputed;                    // Is this a computed field?\n".echo();
"    GrapaCHAR formulaCode;              // Grapa lambda expression for computation\n".echo();
"    GrapaDU64Array dependentFields;     // Fields this formula depends on\n".echo();
"    u64 lastComputedValue;              // Reference to last computed value\n".echo();
"};\n".echo();
"```\n".echo();

"Extended Index Structure:\n".echo();
"```cpp\n".echo();
"// Extended index structure to support formula indexes\n".echo();
"struct GrapaDBIndexFormula {\n".echo();
"    u64 formulaId;                      // Unique formula identifier\n".echo();
"    GrapaCHAR formulaCode;              // Grapa lambda expression\n".echo();
"    u64 resultFieldId;                  // Field ID for computed result (if stored)\n".echo();
"    u8 resultType;                      // Data type of computed result\n".echo();
"    u64 resultSize;                     // Size of computed result\n".echo();
"    bool storeComputedField;            // Whether to store as computed field\n".echo();
"    GrapaDU64Array dependentFields;     // Fields this formula depends on\n".echo();
"};\n".echo();
"```\n".echo();

"Formula Evaluation Engine:\n".echo();
"```cpp\n".echo();
"// Unified formula evaluation for both fields and indexes\n".echo();
"GrapaError GrapaDB::EvaluateFormula(const GrapaCHAR& formulaCode, GrapaCursor& recordCursor, GrapaValue& result)\n".echo();
"{\n".echo();
"    // Parse and execute Grapa lambda expression\n".echo();
"    GrapaValue lambdaResult;\n".echo();
"    err = ExecuteGrapaLambda(formulaCode, recordCursor, lambdaResult);\n".echo();
"    if (err) return(err);\n".echo();
"    \n".echo();
"    // Convert result to appropriate type\n".echo();
"    err = ConvertToTargetType(lambdaResult, result);\n".echo();
"    return(err);\n".echo();
"}\n".echo();
"```\n".echo();

/* ================================================================================ */
/* Test 6: Dependency Management */
/* ================================================================================ */
"Test 6: Dependency Management\n".echo();
"-----------------------------\n".echo();

"Managing field dependencies for computed values:\n".echo();

"Dependency Tracking:\n".echo();
"- Track which fields are used in computed formulas\n".echo();
"- Update computed values when dependent fields change\n".echo();
"- Maintain dependency graph for efficient updates\n".echo();
"- Handle cascading updates for complex dependencies\n".echo();

"Update Process:\n".echo();
"1. Detect Changes: Monitor dependent field changes\n".echo();
"2. Recompute Formula: Evaluate formula for changed records\n".echo();
"3. Update Storage: Update field value or index entry\n".echo();
"4. Maintain Consistency: Ensure all computed values are consistent\n".echo();

"Performance Considerations:\n".echo();
"- Incremental Updates: Only recompute when dependent fields change\n".echo();
"- Background Computation: Compute formulas in background for large datasets\n".echo();
"- Caching: Cache compiled lambda expressions for performance\n".echo();
"- Lazy Evaluation: Evaluate formulas on-demand for read-heavy workloads\n".echo();

/* ================================================================================ */
/* Test 7: Real-World Scenarios */
/* ================================================================================ */
"Test 7: Real-World Scenarios\n".echo();
"----------------------------\n".echo();

"E-commerce Application:\n".echo();

"Computed Fields:\n".echo();
"```grapa\n".echo();
"// Computed field: Product availability status\n".echo();
"products.mkcomputedfield(\"availability_status\", \"STR\", \"VAR\", \n".echo();
"    \"lambda(record) { \n".echo();
"        stock = record.get('stock').raw().int(); \n".echo();
"        if (stock > 0) 'in_stock' \n".echo();
"        else if (stock == 0) 'out_of_stock' \n".echo();
"        else 'backordered' \n".echo();
"    }\");\n".echo();
"\n".echo();
"// Computed field: Price with tax\n".echo();
"products.mkcomputedfield(\"price_with_tax\", \"FLOAT\", \"FIX\", 8,\n".echo();
"    \"lambda(record) { \n".echo();
"        price = record.get('price').raw().float(); \n".echo();
"        tax_rate = record.get('tax_rate').raw().float(); \n".echo();
"        price * (1 + tax_rate) \n".echo();
"    }\");\n".echo();
"```\n".echo();

"Formula Indexes:\n".echo();
"```grapa\n".echo();
"// Index on price tier (not stored as field)\n".echo();
"products.mkformulaindex(\"price_tier_index\", \n".echo();
"    \"lambda(record) { \n".echo();
"        price = record.get('price').raw().float(); \n".echo();
"        if (price < 10) 'budget' \n".echo();
"        else if (price < 50) 'mid_range' \n".echo();
"        else 'premium' \n".echo();
"    }\");\n".echo();
"\n".echo();
"// Index on discount eligibility (not stored as field)\n".echo();
"products.mkformulaindex(\"discount_eligible_index\", \n".echo();
"    \"lambda(record) { \n".echo();
"        price = record.get('price').raw().float(); \n".echo();
"        category = record.get('category'); \n".echo();
"        if (price > 100 && category == 'electronics') true \n".echo();
"        else false \n".echo();
"    }\");\n".echo();
"```\n".echo();

"Financial Application:\n".echo();

"Computed Fields:\n".echo();
"```grapa\n".echo();
"// Computed field: Account balance with interest\n".echo();
"accounts.mkcomputedfield(\"balance_with_interest\", \"FLOAT\", \"FIX\", 8,\n".echo();
"    \"lambda(record) { \n".echo();
"        balance = record.get('balance').raw().float(); \n".echo();
"        interest_rate = record.get('interest_rate').raw().float(); \n".echo();
"        days = record.get('days_since_last_interest').raw().int(); \n".echo();
"        balance * (1 + interest_rate * days / 365) \n".echo();
"    }\");\n".echo();
"```\n".echo();

"Formula Indexes:\n".echo();
"```grapa\n".echo();
"// Index on risk category (not stored as field)\n".echo();
"accounts.mkformulaindex(\"risk_category_index\", \n".echo();
"    \"lambda(record) { \n".echo();
"        balance = record.get('balance').raw().float(); \n".echo();
"        credit_score = record.get('credit_score').raw().int(); \n".echo();
"        if (balance > 10000 && credit_score > 700) 'low_risk' \n".echo();
"        else if (balance > 5000 && credit_score > 600) 'medium_risk' \n".echo();
"        else 'high_risk' \n".echo();
"    }\");\n".echo();
"```\n".echo();

